  "releaseNotes": "2.6.1 repairs malformed classic cross-reference tables, restores spaces implied by large TJ positioning gaps, and adds ExtractTextWithQuality() so callers can detect garbled Latin text layers and route them to OCR. See CHANGELOG.md.",
